  "translation": "Na Asa i singautim nem bilong Yahwe Elohim bilong en, i tok: Yahwe, i no gat narapela wantaim yu bilong helpim, namel long man i gat strong na man i no gat strong. Helpim mipela, Yahwe Elohim bilong mipela, long wanem, long yu olgeta mipela i sanap, na long nem bilong yu mipela i kam antap long ol manmeri hia. Yahwe Elohim bilong mipela, yu ⟨em⟩; no ken lusim man i winim yu.",
